<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<Defs>
  <TerrainDef ParentName="FloorBase">
    <defName>YR_SamokCreep</defName>
    <label>사목 뿌리 지반</label>
    <description>사목의 촉수와 백윤액으로 조성한 생체 지면입니다. 비옥도는 160%이며 철거할 수 있습니다. 이 위의 성인 심연의 신부는 이동·전투·재생 능력이 강화되고 사망하지 않습니다.</description>
    <texturePath>Terrain/Surfaces/Soil</texturePath>
    <color>(0.38,0.20,0.46)</color>
    <edgeType>FadeRough</edgeType>
    <renderPrecedence>350</renderPrecedence>
    <layerable>true</layerable>
    <designationCategory IsNull="True" />
    <placeWorkers>
      <li>YR_RJW.PlaceWorker_SamokCreep</li>
    </placeWorkers>
    <pathCost>0</pathCost>
    <fertility>1.6</fertility>
    <affordances>
      <li>Light</li>
      <li>Medium</li>
      <li>Heavy</li>
      <li>GrowSoil</li>
      <li>Diggable</li>
    </affordances>
    <statBases>
      <WorkToBuild>100</WorkToBuild>
      <Beauty>0</Beauty>
      <Cleanliness>0</Cleanliness>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
    </statBases>
  </TerrainDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>YR_SamokCreepBlessing</defName>
    <label>사목 크립의 가호</label>
    <description>크립 위에서 이동과 전투가 강화되고 손상이 재생됩니다. 크립을 벗어나면 사망 방지와 강화 효과가 사라집니다. 심연의 신부(축복) 상태에서는 이동 속도·근접 피해 배율이 1.5배, 공격 재사용 대기 배율이 0.75배가 되며 부상 회복량이 두 배가 됩니다.</description>
    <hediffClass>YR_RJW.Hediff_SamokCreep</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>2</maxSeverity>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statFactors>
          <MoveSpeed>1.3</MoveSpeed>
          <MeleeDamageFactor>1.25</MeleeDamageFactor>
          <MeleeCooldownFactor>0.85</MeleeCooldownFactor>
          <RangedCooldownFactor>0.85</RangedCooldownFactor>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>2</minSeverity>
        <statFactors>
          <MoveSpeed>1.5</MoveSpeed>
          <MeleeDamageFactor>1.5</MeleeDamageFactor>
          <MeleeCooldownFactor>0.75</MeleeCooldownFactor>
          <RangedCooldownFactor>0.75</RangedCooldownFactor>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <ThingDef>
    <defName>YR_SamokRoot</defName>
    <label>사목 뿌리</label>
    <description>사목의 나무에서 자라 퍼지는 살아 있는 뿌리. 제거하면 그 자리는 재확산을 허용할 때까지 다시 자라지 않습니다.</description>
    <thingClass>Building</thingClass>
    <category>Building</category>
    <drawerType>None</drawerType>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Yuran/Things/Building/Furniture/Tentacle/Rug/A/A_A</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <altitudeLayer>FloorEmplacement</altitudeLayer>
    <passability>Standable</passability>
    <selectable>true</selectable>
    <useHitPoints>true</useHitPoints>
    <size>(1,1)</size>
    <terrainAffordanceNeeded>Light</terrainAffordanceNeeded>
    <building>
      <isEdifice>false</isEdifice>
    </building>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>100</MaxHitPoints>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
      <WorkToBuild>30</WorkToBuild>
    </statBases>
  </ThingDef>
</Defs>
